  "description": "Spreadsheet records for Elarion (ADR-0108): [SpreadsheetRecord] generates the mapping between a partial class and the rows of a worksheet, SpreadsheetWorkbook writes records as an .xlsx workbook, forward-only to a stream, with a styled frozen header, number and date formats and measured column widths, and SpreadsheetReader reads .xlsx, .xlsb and .xls workbooks back into records with every row, every located problem and the columns the file states. No reflection, so an application keeps publishing with NativeAOT.",
